  "mechanism": "the asset prefix is built from getAssetsPath('/') instead of getAssetsPath(''), a trailing slash that next-images copies into its image URLs (/static/search//_next/static/images/...), so imported images answer 404 behind the gateway while the scripts and styles still load",
